OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle battery blaze
OL,4,Aat recycling site
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have been tackling a fire
OL,7,Fat a recycling centre overnight
OL,8,Finvolving about 150 tonnes of
OL,9,Fbatteries.
OL,11,FThe fire near Colthrop Lane in
OL,12,FThatcham, Berkshire, started at about
OL,13,F19:40 BST on Monday. Firefighters from
OL,14,Facross Berkshire were joined by crews
OL,15,Ffrom Oxfordshire, Dorset and Wiltshire,
OL,16,Fand Hampshire and Isle of Wight fire
OL,17,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
