OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle battery blaze
OL,4,Aat recycling site
OL,5,
OL,6,FLarge clouds of thick, black smoke, and
OL,7,Floud bangs could be heard. Royal
OL,8,FBerkshire Fire and Rescue Service is
OL,9,Furging people to avoid the area, stay
OL,10,Finside and keep doors and windows
OL,11,Fclosed as a precaution.
OL,13,FThe fire service said crews had been
OL,14,Fscaled back but expected to remain at
OL,15,Fthe fire through Tuesday.
